/E (The BoD regularly reviews the major risks facing the company and ensures that management has identified and put controls in place to address those risks. This includes financial, operational, strategic, regulatory, cybersecurity, and reputational risks. They oversee the development and effectiveness of risk mitigation strategies and ensure that key risks are being actively managed. Furthermore, the BoD ensures there is proper communication between C-level executives and directors regarding risk issues. They receive regular reports and updates from the management team about the state of risk management efforts, emerging risks, mitigation actions, and any significant risk events.)
