<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Ensuring compliance with relevant laws, regulations, and industry standards is another key responsibility of the BoD. They oversee financial reporting, data protection, and other regulatory requirements while monitoring emerging regulatory risks and ensuring the company is prepared to comply with changes in the regulatory landscape. The BoD may also oversee the work of the C-Level Risk Committee to assess the effectiveness of the company's risk management systems and Business Continuity studies, ensuring that risks are properly managed and that the ERM framework operates as intended.)
/Pg 22 0 R
