/E (The Sustainability Department is responsible for qualitative-quantitative identification of sustainability and climate-related risks and opportunities based on scenario analyses in terms of both physical and transition risks and reports such risks to the Enterprise Risk and Insurance Management Department. Enterprise Risk and Insurance Management Department includes these risks in its reports to the Board-level Early Detection of Risk Committee. Sustainability risks, including climate-related physical and transition risks are considered in the evaluation criteria of business decisions.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [8]
